ETICS aim to enhance coordination among research groups within the Spanish National Health System, promoting collaborative efforts to advance health research and improve health outcomes.", "EPIDEMIOLOGÍA Y SALUD PÚBLICA:CIBEResp is a CIBER center that focuses on epidemiology and public health research in Spain.", "BIOINGENIERÍA, BIOMATERIALES Y NANOMEDICINA:CIBERbbn is a CIBER center that specializes in bioengineering, biomaterials, and nanomedicine research in Spain.", "DIABETES Y ENFERMEDADES METABÓLICAS:CIBERdem is a CIBER center focused on diabetes and metabolic diseases research in Spain.", "FISIOPATOLOGÍA DE LA OBESIDAD Y LA NUTRICIÓN:CIBERobn is a CIBER center that studies the pathophysiology of obesity and nutrition in Spain.", "SALUD MENTAL:CIBERsam is a CIBER center that focuses on mental health research in Spain.", "ENFERMEDADES HEPÁTICAS Y DIGESTIVAS:", "INSTITUTO DE SALUD CARLOS III:The Instituto de Salud Carlos III is a public research institution located in Spain, dedicated to advancing health research and innovation. It plays a crucial role in coordinating various health research networks and platforms, fostering scientific collaboration among researchers. Additionally, the institution provides funding for a wide range of health-related projects, further supporting the development and implementation of health technologies. Through its efforts, the Instituto de Salud Carlos III aims to enhance public health and contribute to the scientific community's understanding of health issues.", "PLATAFORMAS:Las Plataformas de apoyo a la investigación en ciencias y tecnologías de la salud are stable collaborative networks associated with the Instituto de Salud Carlos III, focused on supporting research projects in health sciences and technologies.", "ACTIVIDADES PREVENTIVAS Y PROMOCIÓN DE LA SALUD EN ATENCIÓN PRIMARIA:This is one of the 17 thematic research networks under RETICS, focusing on preventive activities and health promotion in primary care.", "ENFERMEDADES OCULARES:This is one of the 17 thematic research networks under RETICS, focusing on ocular diseases.", "ENFERMEDADES RENALES:This is one of the 17 thematic research networks under RETICS, dedicated to renal diseases.", "ENFERMEDADES TROPICALES:This is one of the 17 thematic research networks under RETICS, focusing on tropical diseases.", "ENFERMEDADES VASCULARES CEREBRALES (ICTUS):This is one of the 17 thematic research networks under RETICS, dedicated to cerebrovascular diseases, including strokes."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}